    "methods_description": "Intracranial EEG recordings were acquired during epilepsy surgery procedures and long-term clinical monitoring. Intraoperative recordings were organized into pre-resection, intermediate, and post-resection sessions relative to surgical resection timing. Long-term recordings were grouped by monitoring period with runs indicating day and time point of acquisition. Electrode configurations included grids, strips, and depth electrodes for ECoG and stereo-encephalography approaches.",
